  "scheduleNotes": [
    "COMMON TO ALL UNITS:",
    "1- Baked on finish over galvanneal steel outer panel",
    "2- Copper tube, aluminum fin evaporator & condenser coil",
    "3- High & low pressure switch",
    "4- Liquid line temperature monitoring & control",
    "5- Adjustable short cycle protection",
    "6- Phase monitor (3-phase units only)",
    "7- High compressor temperature switch",
    "8- Internal motor overload protection",
    "9- Dual high-efficiency scroll compressor",
    "10- Thermal expansion valve",
    "11- Low ambient control",
    "12- Factory installed disconnect",
    "13- 2\" MERV-8 filter",
    "14- Electric heat, if scheduled, shall be single point power",
    "OPTIONS FOR OUTSIDE AIR VENTILATION:",
    "1- Factory installed economizer",
    "2- 2-Position motorized fresh air damper w/ pressure relief ventilation",
    "3- 2-Position motorized fresh air damper w/ pressure relief ventilation & independent control",
    "4- No free cooling, 100% damper opening, emergency ventilation only w/ pressure relief & independent control",
    "CONFIGURATION:",
    "1- Top supply",
    "2- Center Supply/Top Return",
    "OPTIONAL ACCESSORIES:",
    "1- Coastal environmental package:",
    "    • Corrosion resistant fasteners",
    "    • Sealed or partially sealed condenser fan motor",
    "    • Insitu coating applied to all exposed internal copper and metal in the condenser section",
    "    • Protective coating on condenser coil",
    "2- All coat package:",
    "    • Corrosion resistant fasteners",
    "    • Sealed or partially sealed condenser fan motor",
    "    • Insitu coating applied to all exposed internal copper and metal in the condenser section",
    "    • Protective coating on condenser coil",
    "    • Impregnated polyurethane on evaporator coil and Insitu coating on all exterior and interior components and sheet metal",
    "3- Stainless steel exterior (replaces all standard exterior painted surfaces with stainless steel)",
    "4- Stainless steel unit (replaces all interior and exterior steel sheet metal parts with stainless steel)",
    "5- Dirty filter indicator",
    "6- Fresh air damper (field installed on either the left or right hand side of the unit)",
    "7- Filter access from the return air opening",
    "8- Freeze sensor",
    "9- Hot gas bypass"
  ]
